--
As test.desc with ostream<C, T> deriving from ios<...> non-virtually (the
assertion keeps its name).  `o.np' in main is then an "unresolved member
expression" and main is not type-checked; bin53 dropped insert instead.
g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
